    "player_hint_count": "7",
    "player_hint_1_en": "Who can be the man in a cart, per (H)'s clue? (A) on a carpet, (B) in a Condo, (G) in the top row and (I) on the Pickleball Court all can't be in a cart. (C) is the only possibility. This isolates (C) in R5 C2.",
    "player_hint_2_en": "This sets (H) in R6, one row south of (C). This also isolates (F) in the last golf cart, in R8 C7. This sets (I) in the bottom row, R10.",
    "player_hint_3_en": "There's only one remaining chair for (D), this isolates (D) in R9 C1.",
    "player_hint_4_en": "All remaining carpet squares for (A) are all in R7, block the rest of R7. (E), on a bed, can't be in R1 because (G) is already in R1. (E) also can't be in R6, as (H) is in R6, and (A) is in R7. This isolates (E) in R2 C4.",
    "player_hint_5_en": "(B), who's alone in a Condo, can't be in Condo A with (E). (B) must be alone in Condo B in the last remaining square, R4 C10. Block the rest of Condo B.",
    "player_hint_6_en": "This isolates (I). This also isolates (A) on the last carpet square, R7 C3, then (H) in the last square in R6, R6 C6.",
    "player_hint_7_en": "This isolates (G) in the last R1 square, R1 C9, then (V) in the last square, R3 C5. (V) was alone with (E), Eirlys is the murderer!"
  },
